# Campaign Launch Checklist
- [ ] List verified, with bounces removed
- [ ] Every merged fact re-checked against the company's own site
- [ ] Sending domain authenticated (SPF, DKIM, DMARC pass) and DMARC reports going to a parser
- [ ] Mailboxes warmed up gradually, on a plan that supports SMTP/IMAP
- [ ] Daily limit low, and new-lead cap set below the daily cap
- [ ] Plain text, tracking off, opt-out line present
- [ ] One-click unsubscribe header confirmed in Gmail "Show original"
- [ ] Preview checked for every merge field
- [ ] Variants sent as separate campaigns
- [ ] Physical address and sender identity in place (check CAN-SPAM)
- [ ] Review bounces and complaints after the first batch, and pause if either rises
